1335, "Vasudan target got away, Alpha 1.  Advising command to track and neutralize."

1336, "Alpha 1, Isis-class transport en route to terminal.  Destroy transport.  Repeat.  Destroy transport.  No broadcast can leave this sector."

1337, "Aries 3 has made the jump.  Situation out of control.  Return to base."

1338, "Aries 2 has escaped.  Advising command.  Get your head in the fight and complete your mission, Alpha 1."

