2763, "Wipe out the Vasudan pilots that survived the overzealous GTA assault.  Preserve the Terran-Vasudan alliance.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2764, "Destroy all Vasudans in the area.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2765, "GTI has located the Einstein.  You must go in secure the area.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2766, "Must protect a Terran cruiser against Shivan attack.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2767, "Destroy a Shivan cruiser group before the jump out.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2768, "Recover a top secret GTI science station from a Hammer of Light outpost.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2769, "Retrive the science station"

2770, "GTI must capture mining materials necessary for the war effort in the middle of an ionized field.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

